1d:["$","section",null,{"id":"why-us","data-reveal":true,"className":"scroll-mt-24 border-b-hairline-soft py-20","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Why WeEvolveIT"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[26ch] font-display text-display-l font-extrabold text-fg [text-wrap:balance]","children":"Modernize the old system without breaking the running one."}],"$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 font-mono text-body text-fg-secondary","children":"The risk in modernization isn't the new tech — it's breaking what the business runs on today. We de-risk it: assess first, wrap the legacy in APIs, and modernize in stages with rollback at every step. We keep the business logic that works, rebuild only what earns it, and use AI to decode old code faster — all with senior nearshore engineers fluent in both worlds."}],["$","ul",null,{"data-reveal-stagger":true,"className":"mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4","children":[["$","li","De-risked, incremental",{"className":"flex flex-col rounded-xl border-hairline bg-white/[0.015] p-6","children":[false,["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-display-s font-bold text-fg","children":"De-risked, incremental"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-mono text-body-sm text-fg-secondary","children":"We modernize in stages — the business never stops during the change."}]]}],["$","li","Keep what works",{"className":"flex flex-col rounded-xl border-hairline bg-white/[0.015] p-6","children":[false,["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-display-s font-bold text-fg","children":"Keep what works"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-mono text-body-sm text-fg-secondary","children":"Preserve years of business logic; rebuild only the parts that earn it."}]]}],["$","li","AI-assisted",{"className":"flex flex-col rounded-xl border-hairline bg-white/[0.015] p-6","children":[false,["$","h3",null,{"className